{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lines We Draw</strong> is a single-player 3D isometric <strong>narrative strategy game</strong> about duty, empathy, and survival at a Cold War border checkpoint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a border inspector between two rival socialist states, you decide who may cross and who must stay behind. <br>Every document tells a story, and every stamp you press draws a line between <strong>loyalty and humanity</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/4aa56fef597e9a7b5d5cd1c305d6b255.poster.avif?t=1760683902\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/4aa56fef597e9a7b5d5cd1c305d6b255.webm?t=1760683902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/4aa56fef597e9a7b5d5cd1c305d6b255.mp4?t=1760683902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/aa2a549e3036458ab0cdc0af467b40f8.avif?t=1760683902\" width=1417 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years of brutal conflict, an uneasy calm has settled between <strong>Krasnograd</strong> and <strong>Holosztazka</strong>.<br>The borders are reopening, but distrust lingers on both sides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, travelers arrive, families seeking safety, smugglers with contraband, deserters, spies, and ordinary workers caught in the crossfire of politics and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your duty is to inspect their papers, verify their stories, and make a choice: <strong>approve or deny</strong>.<br>Your decisions will shape lives, determine fates, and decide whether peace endures or collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/4707195193e29c84c5b199d8043859df.poster.avif?t=1760683902\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/4707195193e29c84c5b199d8043859df.webm?t=1760683902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/4707195193e29c84c5b199d8043859df.mp4?t=1760683902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/8b748e6440a1ce042db8c4f4d90c6962.avif?t=1760683902\" width=1417 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive documents and examine every detail, names, dates, stamps, photos, permits. <br>Ask questions. Request missing papers. Compare stories and faces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then make your judgment: <strong>do they pass\u2026 or stay behind the wire?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day brings new orders, new rules, and growing pressure from superiors who measure your <strong>accuracy and loyalty</strong>.<br>But ordinary people will remember your <strong>mercy or cruelty</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/75c635c80a7e288781d2c1d764326cb1.poster.avif?t=1760683902\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/75c635c80a7e288781d2c1d764326cb1.webm?t=1760683902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/75c635c80a7e288781d2c1d764326cb1.mp4?t=1760683902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/cd8c28a6ba0016350a18b0dddb00e56a.avif?t=1760683902\" width=1417 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rules and regulations change day by day. Political pressure mounts, and the atmosphere at the checkpoint grows tense.<br>What begins as routine work quickly turns into a moral crossroads - where the fate of individuals, and the balance between nations, rests on your judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices have lasting consequences. You may rise as a hero of the people, become a loyal instrument of the regime, or remain lost in the gray zone between both worlds.<br>At the border, there are no easy decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/aa37b829876d246de2acdecdd16e4c48.poster.avif?t=1760683902\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/aa37b829876d246de2acdecdd16e4c48.webm?t=1760683902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/aa37b829876d246de2acdecdd16e4c48.mp4?t=1760683902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/ad27396360d3e8bd46fba0c379ae6676.avif?t=1760683902\" width=1417 height=228 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Daily border shifts</strong> \u2013 Check passports, visas, and belongings under increasing time pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Moral dilemmas</strong> \u2013 Obey the regime or follow your conscience. Every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Shifting politics</strong> \u2013 Each day brings new rules, restrictions, and unexpected events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Dynamic encounters</strong> \u2013 Refugees, spies, smugglers, soldiers, and desperate families \u2014 each with unique stories and consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Dynamic environment and weather</strong> \u2013 Each day looks a little different. The political situation changes, and so do the shapes of the borders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Branching outcomes</strong> \u2013 Become a hero of the people, a loyal instrument of the regime, or remain lost in the gray zone between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Replay value</strong> \u2013 Treat people differently and experience new endings to the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Distinctive style</strong> \u2013 A semi-realistic visual look inspired by <strong>socialist propaganda art</strong> and <strong>Cold War-era paintings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/452270b868c51914f2faa0ec1df372ab.poster.avif?t=1760683902\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/452270b868c51914f2faa0ec1df372ab.webm?t=1760683902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/extras/452270b868c51914f2faa0ec1df372ab.mp4?t=1760683902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the border, truth is never black and white.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every decision leaves a mark - on others, and on you.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034540?t=1760683902","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034540?t=1760683902","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/d93943793df2ea60e0ae6e2e45e2a43635d770b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760683902","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034540/d93943793df2ea60e0ae6e2e45e2a43635d770b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760683902","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lines We Draw</strong> is a single-player 3D isometric <strong>narrative strategy game</strong> about duty, empathy, and survival at a Cold War border checkpoint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a border inspector between two rival socialist states, you decide who may cross and who must stay behind. <br>Every document tells a story, and every stamp you press draws a line between <strong>loyalty and humanity</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.stea